----------------------- Welcome to A VBBS System ------------------------

      There are two ways of using this BBS, if you have an Amiga you
      can get a copy of the custom terminal program TERMxx.LZH
      and use it -- this gives you all the neat multiwindow features
      and the multitasking capability.  If you don't have an Amiga
      you can log on in ascii mode, just hit RETURN or ESC after this
      message is done.

      NOW EQUIPPED WITH USR DUAL STANDARD MODEMS ON BOTH LINES, WITH
